Fiscal Models
 Top  Previous  Next  
 

All tax and royalty regimes are calculated in cash formulas. Fiscal models are a collection of cash formulas that model tax calculations for certain countries or states. PHDWin has default fiscal models written for the United States, which are available in the Fiscal Models form. If you need to model another countries fiscal regime, you can contact the consulting team for further assistance. 

To apply a fiscal regime to your cases, click on the Forms Flyout and then double-click on Fiscal Models. 

